---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Bruce Bybee Photography">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif mb-8">About</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Bruce Bybee is a Manhattan-based photographer specializing in cultural events, performances, exhibitions, and portraiture.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">He began working with manual analog photography in 2014, developing a disciplined understanding of light, timing, and material process before expanding into digital formats and commissioned work in 2023.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Bruce received a B.A. with honors in Modern Culture and Media from Brown University and completed a certificate in Film Production at FAMU in Prague. His training in visual theory and cinema continues to inform his photographic practice, particularly in his attention to structure, rhythm, and atmosphere.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Originally from Prague, he is a native bilingual Czech–English speaker and has lived and worked between both languages his entire life.</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif mt-12 mb-6">Language & Translation</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Alongside his photographic work, Bruce works professionally as a Czech–English literary translator and interpreter. He began working professionally as a literary translator and interpreter in 2024 and was awarded the Susanna Roth Award for English Translation in 2025.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">His translation work includes contemporary literature, cultural writing, and institutional materials. Services are available for publishers, artists, and cultural organizations, including exhibition texts, press materials, and public programs.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Translation and interpretation inquiries are welcome.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
